                        ],
                        "form": "fossilized"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a0691ece-8fc0-354d-ad88-25a9d33db6e2",
                        "entry_id": "01529013-c7af-3218-9f08-1329df9fdcbc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to make into a fossil"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc2f38b8-b239-44a4-952e-62b8bd9b5ce0",
                                "sense_id": "a0691ece-8fc0-354d-ad88-25a9d33db6e2",
                                "text": "Most of the booths had been scooped clean by the scalpel-sharp corner of the glacier in the crash. Three remained. Two of them were punctured and, inside, the once-human occupants had been fossilized into the walls by centuries upon centuries of patient ice."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd521ad5-1217-3ec2-aca9-7ea5c777a052",
                        "entry_id": "01529013-c7af-3218-9f08-1329df9fdcbc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to become a fossil"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "edb6f40d-2bcf-31b7-b578-a348252f42d5",
                        "entry_id": "01529013-c7af-3218-9f08-1329df9fdcbc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To become inflexible or outmoded."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "figuratively",
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9f1e264-1abc-4293-8712-e1217e72b433",
                                "sense_id": "edb6f40d-2bcf-31b7-b578-a348252f42d5",
                                "text": "I was getting fossilised myself, but of late my stock of ideas has been very much enlarged."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "deb2dccc-3c81-3c5d-8d6e-090f4275c39a",
                        "entry_id": "01529013-c7af-3218-9f08-1329df9fdcbc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To make antiquated, rigid, or fixed; to deaden."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "figuratively",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef3aa30c-1195-4c4c-8fa9-d83d241d6721",
                                "sense_id": "deb2dccc-3c81-3c5d-8d6e-090f4275c39a",
                                "text": "Ten layers of birthdays on a woman's head / Are apt to fossilize her girlish mirth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d62df374-c083-4420-9996-626b6ead1055",
                                "sense_id": "deb2dccc-3c81-3c5d-8d6e-090f4275c39a",
                                "text": "I'll meet you again\nBlanketed in soil\nFossilized in photographs"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "884179da-6885-4b79-ba7e-613e5f73cd7e",
                        "source_entry_id": "01529013-c7af-3218-9f08-1329df9fdcbc",
                        "source_sense_description": "to make into fossil",
                        "target_lang_word": "fossiliser",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fossiliser",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56465026-1ad7-3db7-aa31-cc642801e40f",
                                        "entry_id": "776f6e37-889b-338e-9b91-1e2f84c35e11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Minéraliser, pétrifier, en parlant des organismes contenus dans les strates sédimentaires."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e95e676d-e1e5-4451-9f8c-b89f74c1e116",
                                                "sense_id": "56465026-1ad7-3db7-aa31-cc642801e40f",
                                                "text": "Le bois pétrifié est du bois qui s’est fossilisé."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f14700ae-84e4-4fc6-8cb8-5b88e92ba492",
                                                "sense_id": "56465026-1ad7-3db7-aa31-cc642801e40f",
                                                "text": "Les tissus organiques ne se fossilisent que dans des conditions absolument exceptionnelles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd2e6d78-f5ba-45e9-a003-27aad6703c31",
                                                "sense_id": "56465026-1ad7-3db7-aa31-cc642801e40f",
                                                "text": "Tous ces gens qui font tant d’embarras, adjudants, filles perdues, enfants trouvés, baronnes, employés, employeurs, chanoines ou manœuvres, tous ces gens ou plutôt leurs restes, se rejoignent enfin sans histoires, sans mépris, sans autre but que de fossiliser doucement leurs phosphates de chaux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9022fe21-b7cf-4d7d-9926-45ec4dd34565",
                                                "sense_id": "56465026-1ad7-3db7-aa31-cc642801e40f",
                                                "text": "Les scientifiques ont également collecté des dents fossilisées d'autres types de vertébrés, principalement des mammifères, provenant de la région. À partir de l'émail, ils ont recueilli et analysé des données isotopiques."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c837adb3-b2a0-3712-a092-f5800964ed83",
                                        "entry_id": "776f6e37-889b-338e-9b91-1e2f84c35e11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rigidifier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9396cc3-0006-488f-a8cb-c98ae5cdd3ba",
                                                "sense_id": "c837adb3-b2a0-3712-a092-f5800964ed83",
                                                "text": "Il faut désalourdir, décentraliser le système, l’arracher à cette énorme gangue apparemment inébranlable dans laquelle il se fossilise !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f083b4ce-81da-4b2b-8426-426cc68f5104",
                        "source_entry_id": "01529013-c7af-3218-9f08-1329df9fdcbc",
                        "source_sense_description": "to make into fossil",
                        "target_lang_word": "fossilisieren",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
